## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Likely cause |
|---------|----------------|
| Panel shows “no stage” / Z: — | Wrong scene (use elevator test scene) or missing `Assets/Elevator/` |
| Inner doors never move | `car_root` not set to `elevator_car` prim |
| Outer doors won’t close after open | New `DoorPairController` per request instead of persistent per-floor instance |
| Outer won’t close after inner already closed | Fixed: coordinator must skip already-closed inner before landing close (don’t treat “already closed” as fatal) |
| Inner won’t open after trip when outer already open at destination | Fixed: `request_open_floor` must still open inner when landing is already open |
| Extension on normal Composer | Still enabled in Extension Manager; remove from kit `[dependencies]` if re-added |
| Scene not found | Run `startcomposer_elevator_test.bat`; ensure `elevator_test_scene.usda` exists under `Assets/Elevator/` |

